          "The Levite then cut her body into pieces and sent them throughout Israel to call attention to the crime. The act brought the tribes together, and they demanded that Benjamin hand over the perpetrators. The Benjamites refused, and a civil war broke out between Benjamin and the other Israelite tribes.",
